{"id":28720,"slug":"two-days-one-night","title":"Two Days, One Night","year":2014,"country":"Belgium","duration":95,"spine":771,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/28720-two-days-one-night","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/638030c4f2b05bfe582a2ee9c1927505/mlaNzJGKGDcBJtTPKuzzjW3wfXs8kq_large.jpg","description":"Oscar winner Marion Cotillard received another nomination for her searing, deeply felt performance as a working-class woman desperate to hold on to her factory job, in this gripping film from master Belgian directors Jean-Pierre and Luc Dardenne. Cotillard is Sandra, a wife and mother who suffers from depression and discovers that, while she was home on sick leave, a majority of her coworkers voted in favor of her being laid off over giving up their annual bonuses. She then spends a Saturday and Sunday visiting them each in turn, to try to convince them to change their minds. From this simple premise, the Dardennes create a powerfully humane drama about the importance of community in an increasingly impersonal world.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Luc Dardenne","slug":"luc-dardenne"},{"name":"Jean-Pierre Dardenne","slug":"jean-pierre-dardenne"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Marion Cotillard","role":"Sandra","slug":"marion-cotillard"},{"actor":"Fabrizio Rongione","role":"Manu","slug":"fabrizio-rongione"},{"actor":"Pili Groyne","role":"Estelle","slug":"pili-groyne"},{"actor":"Simon Caudry","role":"Maxime","slug":"simon-caudry"},{"actor":"Catherine Salée","role":"Juliette","slug":"catherine-salee"},{"actor":"Baptiste Sornin","role":"Mr. Dumont","slug":"baptiste-sornin"},{"actor":"Alain Eloy","role":"Willy","slug":"alain-eloy"},{"actor":"Myriem Akheddiou","role":"Mireille","slug":"myriem-akheddiou"},{"actor":"Fabienne Sciascia","role":"Nadine","slug":"fabienne-sciascia"},{"actor":"Timur Magomedgadzhiev","role":"Timur","slug":"timur-magomedgadzhiev"},{"actor":"Hicham Slaoui","role":"Hicham","slug":"hicham-slaoui"},{"actor":"Phil